---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Our Web Design Process | Shelby Web Company"
  description="See how Shelby Web Company works — from a friendly pre-discovery conversation to a strategic SEO plan to the build, launch, and beyond."
>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden py-20 lg:py-28 px-4" data-animate>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_15%_10%,rgba(34,211,238,0.15),transparent_40%),radial-gradient(circle_at_85%_20%,rgba(132,204,22,0.12),transparent_42%),radial-gradient(circle_at_50%_100%,rgba(30,64,175,0.20),transparent_52%)]"></div>

    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto relative z-10">
      <p class="text-brand-glow text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">How We Work</p>
      <h1 class="font-heading text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-black text-white tracking-tight leading-[0.95] mb-6">
        No Red Tape. <span class="text-brand-accent">Just Process.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-white/80 text-lg md:text-xl max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
        Every project starts with a <span class="text-brand-cyan font-semibold">simple conversation</span>, gets shaped by research, and is built with a clear plan in mind. Here is exactly how it happens.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="px-4 py-20" data-animate>
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto space-y-16">
      <article class="grid lg:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-8 items-start">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-brand-accent/10 border border-brand-accent/30 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-accent text-3xl font-black shrink-0">1</div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-brand-accent text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] font-bold mb-2">The Friendly Pre-Discovery</p>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl text-white font-bold mb-4">Our Conversation Comes First</h2>
          <p class="text-white/85 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Before we talk pixels or code, we talk about <span class="text-brand-cyan font-semibold"><em>you</em></span>. Your pre-discovery call is a friendly conversation — no jargon, no pressure — where we dig into what makes your business unique and what you need online.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-white/80 text-base leading-relaxed">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-brand-cyan font-bold mt-1">✓</span> Who you serve and what makes you <span class="text-white font-semibold">different from every competitor</span>.</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-brand-cyan font-bold mt-1">✓</span> Your goals — <span class="text-white font-semibold">more calls, more leads, more visibility</span>, or all three.</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-brand-cyan font-bold mt-1">✓</span> What's working (or painfully not working) on your current online presence.</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-brand-cyan font-bold mt-1">✓</span> Your customers, your service area, and the words they <span class="text-brand-blue font-semibold">actually search for</span>.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="grid lg:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-8 items-start">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-brand-blue/15 border border-brand-blue/40 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-cyan text-3xl font-black shrink-0">2</div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-brand-blue-light text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] font-bold mb-2">The Strategy Map</p>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl text-white font-bold mb-4">Research Becomes a Plan</h2>
          <p class="text-white/85 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Your pre-discovery notes aren't filed away — they become the <span class="text-brand-cyan font-semibold">blueprint</span>. We map out a strategic SEO and content plan tailored to the keywords, geography, and customers we uncovered together.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-white/80 text-base leading-relaxed">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-brand-blue font-bold mt-1">✓</span> Keyword and competitor research grounded in your <span class="text-white font-semibold">actual market</span>.</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-brand-cyan font-bold mt-1">✓</span> A content and page structure built to <span class="text-white font-semibold">win local search</span>.</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-brand-cyan font-bold mt-1">✓</span> Clear milestones, timelines, and deliverables before a single line of code.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="grid lg:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-8 items-start">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-brand-cyan/10 border border-brand-cyan/30 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-cyan text-3xl font-black shrink-0">3</div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-brand-cyan text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] font-bold mb-2">The Build</p>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl text-white font-bold mb-4">Then the Build Begins</h2>
          <p class="text-white/85 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">
            With the plan locked in, we design and build your site to that roadmap — <span class="text-brand-cyan font-semibold">fast, modern, and optimized</span> from the ground up. You stay in the loop at every stage.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-white/80 text-base leading-relaxed">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-brand-accent font-bold mt-1">✓</span> Design, copy, and build all follow the <span class="text-white font-semibold">strategy we agreed on</span>.</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-brand-cyan font-bold mt-1">✓</span> Review rounds keep you <span class="text-white font-semibold">in control, never surprised</span>.</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-brand-blue font-bold mt-1">✓</span> Launch with SEO foundations, analytics, and performance checks already in place.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="px-4 pb-24" data-animate>
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto rounded-3xl border border-brand-blue/30 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-darkest via-brand-dark to-brand-darkest p-10 md:p-14 text-center">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Ready to Start the Conversation?</h2>
      <p class="text-white/80 text-lg mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        It begins with a <span class="text-brand-cyan font-semibold">simple pre-discovery call</span>. No pressure, no obligation — just a friendly talk about your business.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact/" class="cta-glow-shine inline-block bg-brand-accent text-[#0A0A0A] px-10 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold hover:bg-brand-accent-light">
        Book Your Discovery Call
      </a>
      <p class="text-brand-sky/60 text-sm mt-6">
        Prefer reading first? Explore our <a href="/services/web-design/" class="text-brand-cyan hover:underline">web design</a> and <a href="/services/seo/" class="text-brand-cyan hover:underline">SEO services</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>